        <p class="opacity-90 mb-8 max-w-[500px] mx-auto" style="word-break: keep-all;" data-ko="무료 상담을 통해 비즈니스에 맞는 영상 솔루션을 제안해 드립니다." data-en="Let's discuss how video can transform your business. Free consultation available.">
          Let's discuss how video can transform your business. Free consultation available.
